

Add weather. Clouds are randomized with multi-layered perlin noise so that somtimes there are no clouds at all, and sometimes there are a lot of clouds. This cloud "texture" should move across the sky at "weather-speed". Clouds get darker there more there are and when the sky is full of clouds, make it rain.




Since sometimes stuff will be visible form the top, here a few improvements to the grass billboards:
- Add a "top" texture to the grass billboards, so that they look better when seen from above.
 slowly fade this texture in when the camera is above the grass and the player is at least 4m above the ground.
 - Make the grass billboards at the last LOD follow the camera vertically also so they look up and down. Limit this at a 45 degree angle.


